features
    PC_Configurator
        mandatory
            CPU
                alternative
                    Intel
                    AMD
            Motherboard
                alternative
                    LGA_1700
                    AM5
            Motherboard_Chipset
                alternative
                    Z790
                    AM4
            RAM_Type
                alternative
                    DDR4
                    DDR5
            GPU
                alternative
                    RTX_4090
            GPU_Length
                alternative
                    350
                    360
                    340
            GPU_Clearance
                alternative
                    ATX
                    Micro_ATX
                    Small_Air_Cooler
            Case
                alternative
                    ATX
                    Micro_ATX
                    Large_Air_Cooler

constraints
    "CPU selection must be one of the options listed above."
    "GPU must be supported by the chosen Case."
    "Case must match the chosen CPU."
    "RAM type must match the chosen CPU."